     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>Is anyone else experiencing problems with leaflet markers? I have not changed the code, but mine have disappeared completely on chrome. When previewing in Rstudio IDE they are there. When viewing from safari, they are missing icons.</div><div><br></div><div>on IDE</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-o7pNAHGcCnU/Wx7Cls8dmAI/AAAAAAAAODE/pEHwVtZhr2Uq6lqQkIhsFFdbIf64N7WVwCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-06-11%2Bat%2B11.42.02%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-o7pNAHGcCnU/Wx7Cls8dmAI/AAAAAAAAODE/pEHwVtZhr2Uq6lqQkIhsFFdbIf64N7WVwCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2018-06-11%252Bat%252B11.42.02%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359741506000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1v6UC6iWw7RTt7DnFgmKAD\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-o7pNAHGcCnU/Wx7Cls8dmAI/AAAAAAAAODE/pEHwVtZhr2Uq6lqQkIhsFFdbIf64N7WVwCLcBGAs/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-06-11%2Bat%2B11.42.02%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"208\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">empty in chrome, and in safari:</p><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-s_pPnGdx6ws/Wx7Bzdx_FVI/AAAAAAAAOC8/GFC0HSWVLgARxvZ94JU68mE6SNWBAAl7ACLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-06-11%2Bat%2B11.36.30%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-s_pPnGdx6ws/Wx7Bzdx_FVI/AAAAAAAAOC8/GFC0HSWVLgARxvZ94JU68mE6SNWBAAl7ACLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2018-06-11%252Bat%252B11.36.30%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359741506000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3A1CEZkShlbUQEiStixW0X\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-s_pPnGdx6ws/Wx7Bzdx_FVI/AAAAAAAAOC8/GFC0HSWVLgARxvZ94JU68mE6SNWBAAl7ACLcBGAs/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2018-06-11%2Bat%2B11.36.30%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"120\"></a></p><div>I am seeing some recent discussion here:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://gis.stackexchange.com/questions/230875/why-does-leaflet-with-provider-tiles-not-draw-markers-as-expected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gis.stackexchange.com/questions/230875/why-does-leaflet-with-provider-tiles-not-draw-markers-as-expected&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359741506000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1P7OKo8MtrJ7rCa1F7qO1J\">https://gis.stackexchange.com/questions/230875/why-does-leaflet-with-provider-tiles-not-draw-markers-as-expected</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>and </div><div><br></div><div>here: <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/leaflet/issues/422\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/leaflet/issues/422&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359741506000&amp;usg=AOvVaw282IgyyeqqRCJVSqEPXiqX\">https://github.com/rstudio/leaflet/issues/422</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>Does shinyapps need to update its leaflet library?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>  #Site Map</div><div>  d&lt;-read.csv(&quot;newSites.csv&quot;,row.names=1)</div><div>  d$Site&lt;-rownames(d)</div><div>  m &lt;- leaflet(d) %&gt;% addTiles() %&gt;% addMarkers(~long,~lat,popup=~paste(Site,paste(min_elev,max_elev,sep=&quot; - &quot;)))</div><div>  output$mymap &lt;- renderLeaflet(m)</div></div></code></div><br></div><div>and </div><div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">leafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mymap&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br> in the UI</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div></div>"
